			<div class="content" id="post-content-2760461">
									

<p>This really intrigued me, but I think I'm gonna keep a neutral vote for now.</p>
<p>Main complaints:<br />
1) Not enough detail in the descriptions. I honestly don't blame you for avoiding trying to come up with words to describe the sixth dimension, but <em>goddamn</em> do I want to be able to picture it a little. Kinda the burn you get for playing with this fire but, again, I don't blame you. Still a better job than I could've done.<br />
2) Not enough detail about the 6-cube. How did the department of tesseractic geometry open the portal? What happened then? I don't need a full-blown tale or anything but it really left me wondering.</p>
<p>All-in-all though, interesting concept.</p>

